\f4\b0\fs26 \cf0 # Neonwhistle Automation\'a0&\'a0AI \'96 Lean\'a0MVP Stack\
\
A five\uc0\u8209 container setup that delivers:\
\
| Service | Purpose | URL (example) |\
|---------|---------|---------------|\
| **Caddy 2** | TLS & reverse proxy | *edge* |\
| **n8n 1.44** | No\uc0\u8209 code automations & queue mode | `https://automation.neonwhistle.com` |\
| **Postgres\'a015 + pgvector** | Relational + vector DB | internal only |\
| **PostgREST** | Supabase\uc0\u8209 style REST & GraphQL over Postgres | `https://api.neonwhistle.com` |\
| **Redis\'a07** | Queue + cache for n8n | internal only |\
\
